# A quieter page

Djot stays Djot. Edit the markers, select a sentence, copy the source, or toggle djot-modern-mode to compare the original display.

## Words with texture

A little _emphasis_, a *strong* opinion, a {=highlight=}, an {+addition+}, and a {-deletion-}. Water is H~2~O and a square is x^2^. Inline `code *stays literal*` and $`x + y` keep their punctuation.

Visit [the Djot reference](https://djot.net) or <https://djot.net>. A [quiet span]{.note} carries attributes without losing its source.

