## A modest table

| Element | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| Heading | A place to begin |
| `x|y` | A literal pipe |
| a\|b | An escaped pipe |

^ Aligned source and thin, padded presentation.

***

## Literal punctuation

Escaped \*stars\* and \_underscores\_ stay plain. A backslash protects a table pipe: \|. `# headings` do not appear inside verbatim text.

A reference [link][reference] and a footnote[^note] remain readable source.

[reference]: https://djot.net

[^note]: This is a footnote, not a popup.

## Work in progress

An *unfinished delimiter is ordinary editing, not an error dialog.
